    <briefdescription>
<para>Container component for the miscellaneous options panel. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>On Start it initialises its child UIVisibilityManager, ModelPlaneDetectionManager, and PivotSettingManager components (which require manual initialisation after singletons are ready), then hides the panel until it is needed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
